Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='gatekeptpasses', at=datetime(2026, 10, 5, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="A tree step's pass is kept, keyed by the files it reads, so a re-gate runs only the steps whose inputs moved", body="A tree step's PASS IS KEPT (2026-10-05) in `.git/gate/`, keyed by HEAD's entries outside the paths it declares it never reads (`--list` prints each) and the environment the steps read, so a re-gate runs only the steps whose inputs moved; only a clean checkout reads or keeps a pass, and a step that reads what another writes outside the tree is kept or run `together` with it. A step may be split into UNITS, each kept by what it reads (2026-10-12): `test` by workspace member from `cargo metadata`, `web-test` and `e2e` by test file from esbuild's import graph, the live pins by `live_reads`; the leak guard keeps each clean file by its hash and its rules' hash; `--full` reads no pass, and the train runs it on the first train gated a day after a fully passed tree landed; a half's lanes run side by side (the Rust's checks and its tests apart, so the tests' runs leave cargo's lock to the checks), then e2e alone, in four shards (20 of 20 green on 2026-10-17, 253 to 271 s against about 600 s in one). `deployed-shape`, never kept, renders the site and runs the dry data push from HEAD's public tree as a deploy runs it (a read-only store path, no `.git`, the units' PATH, as nobody under root), with the release binary public-tree built.", rationale='Kept passes since 2026-10-05; units since 2026-10-12. The four e2e shards: 20 of 20 green on 2026-10-17, 253 to 271 s against about 600 s in one.', supersedes=()))